2. Synthetic Gaussian cluster datasets

Datasets:
  - gau
  - gau_g

Source:
  Generated by the authors of this package.

Use in this package:
  The dataset `gau` contains synthetic 20-dimensional Gaussian cluster
  observations for reproducible examples of PCA and differentially
  private PCA visualization. The dataset `gau_g` contains the same
  observations and numeric features with an additional group label.

